OL,3,GNEWSA'I can't see it stopping' -
OL,4,AMiddlesbrough's young men discuss gangs
OL,5,Aafter A66 crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FInside Hemlington Boxing Club in
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough, music is drowned out by
OL,9,Fthe sound of gloves hitting pads.
OL,11,FFor young men here, nights in the ring
OL,12,Fare far better than the alternative.
OL,14,FBecause outside, away from the bright
OL,15,Flights of the gym, riders wearing
OL,16,Fbalaclavas roar past on quad bikes in
OL,17,Fthe darkness.
OL,19,F"You see it all the time," says Dylan,
OL,20,Fa 20-year-old who trains at the club.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
